            ('What AI search engines are there?', 'The ones most people meet are ChatGPT, Gemini, Microsoft Copilot, Perplexity, Claude, Meta AI and Grok, plus the AI answers Google shows above its own results.\nOur register lists sixteen AI answer engines in all, and the search, map, video, social and voice engines beside them.'),
            ('What AI search engines are free to use?', 'At the time of writing, most offer a free version: ChatGPT, Gemini, Copilot, Perplexity, Claude and Meta AI among them, with paid plans for heavier use.\nThat matters to a business owner for one reason. If it is free, your customers are already asking it.'),
            ('Which AI does Google search use?', 'Google uses its own Gemini models. They write the AI Overviews shown above search results, they run AI Mode, and they are the Gemini assistant.\nThey draw on Google’s index and on Business Profiles, so the work done for Google search carries over.'),
            ('Which are the best AI search engines for finding a local business?', 'There is no single one, and the answer differs by person and by day. What matters to an owner is being named by whichever engine the customer happens to ask.\nThat is why we track ten of them for each client and do the same work for all.'),
