        h1='ChatGPT SEO: how your business gets recommended',
        answer='ChatGPT SEO is the work that decides whether ChatGPT names your business when someone asks who to hire. It turns on three things: whether ChatGPT can read your site, whether other sources confirm what it says, and whether there are signs that real people chose you. Nobody can buy a recommendation, and nobody can promise one.',
