              ('What do review management services do?', 'They handle the routine part of the work: asking for reviews, watching for new ones and replying. Review management services cover every platform that matters for your trade.\nThe replies are written in your voice and can be approved by you first.'),
              ('What is the best reputation management company for a local business?', 'One that asks every customer, answers every review and refuses to fake anything. Ask a firm plainly how it gets reviews.\nIf the answer involves writing them, buying them or screening who is asked, walk away. The penalties fall on you.'),
