              ('How to do ecommerce SEO on a new store?', 'Start with categories. Decide what search each one answers, and write a short, useful introduction for it.\nThen write your own product descriptions, add product markup and connect Google Merchant Center. Leave blog posts until all of those are done and working.'),
              ('How to improve ecommerce SEO on an existing store?', 'Find out what Google has indexed and remove the waste first: filtered duplicates, empty categories, old test pages.\nThen improve the categories that already get impressions in Search Console. They are the nearest to earning sales, so work on them pays back soonest.'),
