        hero([('Home', '/'), ('About', '')], 'About', 'About Relevant Search Media: how the D’Souza Equation came about',
             'Relevant Search Media is a search company founded in 2020 by Thomas D’Souza. It makes a business the answer its customers get, on Google and on every AI engine. It works for businesses in the United States only, and it works by one published method: the D’Souza Equation.',
             'Relevant Search Media was founded in 2020 on one idea: relevant search, relevant traffic, relevant leads.', ctas=(('Book a discovery call', '/book/'), ('See all 413 checks', '/dsouza-equation/standard/'))),
