              ('How fast can a plumbing company show on the map?', 'Profile fixes can show within weeks. Moving into the three map results for busy searches usually takes months, and depends on reviews and distance.\nGoogle weighs how close you are to the searcher, so nearby suburbs come first and distant ones follow later.'),
